VideoKit v4.4.55 release trigger

Includes batch import performance and stability improvements:
- SRT and TXT batch imports parse files without rebuilding the full batch table for every file
- folder/material-group companion SRT/TXT reads use asynchronous text I/O
- mixed media imports coalesce batch table/task-list refreshes into one final UI update
- single-file imports keep immediate feedback while batch operations avoid repeated redraws
- reduces white-screen and unresponsive-window risk while another template is rendering
- retains previous v4.4.54 fixes
